@@ -0,0 +1,36 @@
+# Feature: Results, Governance & Usage
+
+## Results (Output center)
+Structured outputs from **Task execute** (and linked chat work): quotations, availability options, reservations, analysis text.
+
+| Source | How to open |
+|--------|-------------|
+| Task finished | Home recent / Inbox / Open result |
+| Chat with saved work | Link on agent message |
+| Sidebar **Results** library | Search + filters |
+
+Chat **advisory** mode does not write tool results here.
+
+## Governance
+Company control plane for Owner / roles with `governance.read`:
+
+- Overview stats
+- Agents status
+- Recent audit slice
+
+Day-to-day human gates remain **Approvals** / **Inbox**. Full trail: **Audit log**.
+
+## Plan & usage
+Quota and consumption (`usage.read`): Owner, Administration, Accounting typically.
+
+## Backend
+- Tasks store `result` JSON with `tool_results`
+- `GET /companies/{id}/governance/overview`
+- `GET /companies/{id}/governance/agents`
+- `GET /companies/{id}/governance/audit`
+- Usage endpoints under plan/quotas
+
+## Flow
+```
+Task execute → (approval if needed) → Results panel → Governance/Audit for oversight
+```
