+# MVP QA checklist (frontend path)
+
+Use after Jobs 62–72. Check each box on a clean browser session (Ctrl+F5).
+
+## A. Auth & company
+- [ ] Register company → verify email (debug token) → login email+password
+- [ ] Complete **Company profile** → sidebar unlocks
+- [ ] Owner invites AI Admin + Reservation; accept invitation works
+- [ ] Reservation cannot see Users / Hire forms
+
+## B. Workforce & data
+- [ ] Hire AI Employee from catalog; grant operational `can_use`
+- [ ] Knowledge: extract file + manual note; file not retained message
+- [ ] Inventory: seed demo; list shows products
+- [ ] Marketplace: Install then Hire path clear
+- [ ] Policies: create allow / require_approval; unmatched tools denied
+
+## C. Work loop
+- [ ] Home quick actions match role
+- [ ] Chat advisory + spinner; “Also create Task” when allowed
+- [ ] Tasks: create consult/execute; run buttons work
+- [ ] Approvals: only approval.manage can approve
+- [ ] Results show availability/quotation when tools ran
+- [ ] Notifications / Inbox surface pending items
+
+## D. Docs
+- [ ] `docs/features/00_PRODUCT_WALKTHROUGH.md` followed once end-to-end
